# 4. Application does not invoke PAM modules
# 5. Container runs as non-root user without PAM privileges
#
# Mitigations Applied:
# - Non-root container execution (USER mercuryagent)
# - login/passwd packages purged from runtime image
# - SUID/SGID bits removed from all binaries
